{"version":1,"content":"<p>IBM近日發佈新一代量子處理器Nighthawk r3，並公佈了未來量子計算發展計劃。這款全新處理器被設計為能夠執行多達10000次量子操作，在保持運算質量和速度的同時處理更加複雜的大規模計算任務，標誌着IBM向容錯量子計算目標邁出了重要一步。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585986.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T18:43:14.160308+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T18:24:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T18:36:13.263392+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T18:36:13.263392+00:00","content_hash":"a0f414cbff6ce48937d517f7f01e2e757b179d375c6c5b1dff3af58689cebfd4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}